n<div class=\"watch_botton\">\n<div class=\"button_box\">\n<button class=\"the_first\">Product Details</button>\n<p><input id=\"productID\" name=\"productID\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"78925383\"/></p><p><strong>4 Inch Electric Multistage Submersible Pump</strong><br/></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231604475987612.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image007(001).jpg\"/></p><p>We supply 4 Inch Electric Multistage Submersible Pump. JIADI is a professional manufacturer and exporter of water pumps, own the import  and export authority. We have the professional team for design, produce and sales.  Have all kinds of goods, passed ISO9001 and CE certificates.</p><p><strong>Categories:</strong> submersible pumps</p><p><strong>Flow</strong> (m3/h): 5 / 15.7</p><p><strong>Head</strong> (m): 4 / 186</p><p><strong>Power</strong> (kW): 0.75 / 7.5</p><p><strong>Performance Curve:</strong></p><p><strong>Construction:</strong><strong><img alt=\"image009(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231606038372412.jpg\"/></strong></p><p><strong><img alt=\"image005(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231604461286489.jpg\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"/></strong></p><p>Submersible motor pumps for deep wells of 4″ (DN 100 mm).</p><p>Sized for connection to the motor according to NEMA Standards.</p><p>Delivery casing with built-in non-return valve.</p><p>Delivery port G 2. Radial floating impeller with high reliability operating in sandy water.</p><p><strong>Performance:</strong></p><p>Capacity up to 15.7 m3/h.</p><p>Head up to 186 m.</p><p>Rated motor power output up to 7.5 kW.</p><p>Rotation speed 2850 r.p.m. (motor frequency 50 Hz).</p><p><strong>Applications:</strong></p><p>Water supply, civil and industrial applications, garden use and irrigation.</p><p><img alt=\"image011(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231606597442834.jpg\"/></p><p><strong>Operating conditions:</strong></p><p>Water temperature up to 35 °C.</p><p>Max. sand quantity into the water: 150 g/m3.</p><p>Continuous duty. </p><p><strong>Packing and Shipping: </strong></p><p>Export standard carton with Plastic bag or Foam.</p><p>Delivery Time &amp; Port:20-30days/Ningbo port or Shanghai port or Lianyungang port</p><p><strong>FAQ:</strong></p><p><strong>Q1: How long is the warranty of our company’s products?</strong></p><p>A: 1 year usually.</p><p><strong>Q2: Are you a factory or a trading company?</strong></p><p>A: We are a manufacturer that specializes in water pumps for more than 30 years.</p><p><strong>Q3: How can I place order? </strong></p><p>A: You can contact us by email about your order details.</p><p><strong>Q4: How can I pay you? </strong></p><p>A: After you confirm our PI, we will request you to pay. T/T and Paypal, Western Union are the most usual ways we are using. </p><p><strong>Q5: How do you take care when your clients received defective products? </strong></p><p>A: replacement. If there are some defective items, we usually credit to our customer or replace in next shipment. </p><p><strong><br/></strong><br/></p><p><br/></p>\n</div>\n<p class=\"productsTags\"> Hot Tags: 4 inch electric multistage submersible pump, China, suppliers, manufacturers, buy</p>\n<div class=\"ptit\">Related Products</div>\n<ul class=\"rollPro1\">\n<li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/6-submersible-pump/6-submersible-impeller-pump/6-inch-big-capacity-submersible-pump\"><img alt=\"6 Inch Big Capacity Submersible Pump\" border=\"0\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/small/agricultural-submersible-pump40593228970a77d.jpg?size=263x0\"/></a></div>\n<p><a href=\"/6-submersible-pump/6-submersible-impeller-pump/6-inch-big-capacity-submersible-pump\">6 Inch Big Capacity Submersible Pump</a></p>\n</li><li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/submersible-motor/3-5-inch-ac-electric-submersible-motor\"><img alt=\"3.5 Inch AC Electric Submersible Motor\" border=\"0\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/small/3-5-electric-submersible-motor26472711761a77d.jpg?size=263x0\"/></a></div>\n<p>